{"id":"claim:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative--noun-suffixes-consist-of-only-three-morphemes-two","revision":1,"topic":"topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative","topics":["topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative","topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative--morphology"],"statement":{"en":"Noun suffixes consist of only three morphemes: two follow general nouns, while the third follows positionals, all serving to extend or modify the meaning of the host.","ja":"名詞接尾辞はわずか3個の形態素からなり、2個は一般名詞に後続し、3個目は位置名詞に後続して、いずれも先行する形式の意味を拡張または修飾する働きをする。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0070-14","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative--under-a-narrow-definition-excluding-verb-formatives-and","revision":1,"topic":"topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative","topics":["topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative","topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative--morphology"],"statement":{"en":"Under a narrow definition excluding verb formatives and postpositions, Shizunai Ainu has three noun suffixes: -ke, -po, and -utar.","ja":"動詞形成形態素や後置詞を除外した狭義の定義では、静内アイヌ語の名詞接尾辞は -ke、-po、-utar の3つである。"},"type":"membership","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-ke","-po","-utar"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0152-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative--the-diminutive-suffix-po-is-derived-from-the","revision":1,"topic":"topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative","topics":["topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative","topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative--okkaypo"],"statement":{"en":"The diminutive suffix -po is derived from the independent noun po 'child/son'.","ja":"指小辞 -po は独立名詞 po「子供・息子」に由来する。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-po","po"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0152-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative--the-suffix-po-functions-as-an-affectionate-or","revision":1,"topic":"topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative","topics":["topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative","topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative--overview"],"statement":{"en":"The suffix -po functions as an affectionate or familiar kinship term suffix, as in achipo 'father/dad', hapo 'mother/mom', yupo 'older brother', and kakapo 'older sister'.","ja":"接尾辞 -po は親愛を表す愛称または親称として機能し、achipo「父さん」、hapo「母さん」、yupo「兄さん」、kakapo「姉さん」などを形成する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-po","achipo","hapo","yupo","kakapo"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0181-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative--the-element-mo-small-occurs-in-the-meaning","revision":1,"topic":"topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative","topics":["topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative","topic:nominal/nominal-derivation-diminutive-augmentative--prenominal-size"],"statement":{"en":"The element mo 'small' occurs in the meaning 'small' only as a constituent in a limited set of words, such as mo-rew 'small curve'.","ja":"mo を「小さい」の意味で使うのは、mo-rew「小さな曲線」のような限られた語の構成要素としてだけである。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["mo","mo-rew"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0488-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
